## Why This Is Asked

Tests beginner CAPA in ML deployment with concrete data model, lifecycle, API, metrics, and root-cause analysis; emphasizes data protection and cross-regional containment.

## Key Concepts

- CAPA data model
- Lifecycle state machine
- Minimal REST API
- Evidence management
- Containment metrics
- Canary testing

